Lovely 1-bedroom apartment with balcony and modern design for sale in Amwaj! HOT DEAL!
86 sqm - 50,000 BHD (Negotiable)
Flat is in good condition with good view. Building is managed nicely, clean facilities and corridors, security is always available at the reception.  

Flat has open plan kitchen, spacious living room, balcony, 2 washrooms, assigned car parking. 

Modern building has:

- 21 floors of apartments;                                                                                    
- 2 levels of car parking;                                                                                                
- outdoor pool, jacuzzi, gym, steam &amp; sauna;
- central AC;
- reception &amp; 24/7 security;
-  BBQ area.

Building located in the heart of Amwaj Islands, near Lagoon park, 24 hours supermarket, cafes, salons, kids education center.                                         

Ready to move in. Flat is available now.                                                                                          

To get more information on availability or any further inquires, please contact Yana (38000907)

