This stunning luxury villa with a private swimming pool, garden, private elevator, and lovely sea views is an inviting and must-see property;

Boasting extremely good quality finishes, this villa consists of a living area with double ceilings and wall-to-wall glass windows that overlook the garden and swimming pool area;

A modern kitchen with an island, with the latest built-in appliances;

A spacious family lounge the great views and 2 bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and en-suite bathrooms on the 1st floor;

2 bedrooms with all ensuite bathrooms and built-in closets on the 2nd floor, the Master bedroom has a walk-in closet and a big private terrace overlooking the city;

Maids room on the ground floor with a separate entrance and a separate laundry room;


Viewing by appointment only;

For more updates on this and other luxurious properties, please contact Edna — your trusted RERA Certified Senior Property Consultant.

